<title>GERMANY: German October engineering orders fell three pct.</title>
<headline>German October engineering orders fell three pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>German engineering orders fell by three percent in real terms in October from the same 1995 month, the engineering industry association VDMA said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In the three months from August though October orders were 11 percent below the same 1995 period. The VDMA statement gave the following data</p>
<p>    October    change in pct    Aug-Oct	   change in pct</p>
<p>    overall	    -3	   overall		-11</p>
<p>    of which German  -1	   of which German    -11</p>
<p>    foreign	    -4	   foreign		-10</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
